## 7. Conclusion

Workshop 3 established the strategic attack scenarios for the AI-SCMIS by examining its ecosystem, assessing stakeholder exposure, identifying potential attack paths, and evaluating scenario gravity.

The workshop retained 14 strategic scenarios, classified into three critical scenarios (G4), nine serious scenarios (G3), and two significant scenarios (G2).

These results provide the foundation for Workshop 4, where the selected strategic scenarios will be developed into operational scenarios to examine the technical and organizational means through which the attacks could be carried out.

**Workshop 3 outcome:** Fourteen strategic scenarios established and classified, providing the basis for operational scenario analysis in Workshop 4.
